+ *   - Lookla is operated by a natural person, not a company — there is no
+ *     VAT number, company registration or registered office to cite.
+ *   - No booking can be made: the availability-request endpoints exist in the
+ *     API but no page links to them, so the site cannot take a reservation.
+ *   - No paid plan can be bought: /pricing redirects to the homepage and the
+ *     payment provider is entirely unconfigured, so no charge is possible.
+ *   - Messaging between users and salons IS reachable (/account/messages).
+ *   - Salon records are compiled from public sources (Google, Vrisko,
+ *     Treatwell, Foursquare) by a crawler, which is why the accuracy and
+ *     objection sections exist and say what they say.
